# classic cards: two decks of 16 (spec 4.5). The effect KINDS are the classic ones; the WORDING is the house's own (owner decision O1: reword freely, no code change).
# CARD | deck | n | kind | a | b | text      deck: luck | fund     n: 1..16 (unique per deck)
#   kind: move_to(a = tile idx; passing Start pays) | nearest_rail | nearest_util | move_back(a = steps) | go_jail | keep_card | collect(a) | pay(a) | collect_each(a) | pay_each(a) | repairs(a per house, b per hotel)
#   RULES effects are from memory of the standard deck kinds: to be checked against the official sheet (spec 4.12).
